bubble\" style=\"position:static\"><h3>Say it back</h3><ul><li>おはよう</li><li>こんばんは</li><li>おやすみ</li></ul><p style=\"font:500 16px/1.8 var(--f-body)\">Record each greeting. Your teacher replies within a day.</p></div></div></section>","pricing":"<section class=\"np-sec\"><div class=\"np-h\"><i>円</i><h2>Pricing</h2></div><div class=\"np-price\"><div><span class=\"p\">Free</span><ul><li>Hiragana &amp; katakana</li><li>Daily 10-minute lesson</li><li>Community forum</li></ul><a class=\"np-btn m\" href=\"#\">Start free</a></div><div class=\"hl\"><span class=\"p\">RM 69<small style=\"font:700 14px var(--f-body)\"> /mo</small></span><ul><li>All courses N5–N3</li><li>Teacher feedback</li><li>Offline mode</li></ul><a class=\"np-btn\" href=\"#\">Try 7 days free</a></div><div><span class=\"p\">RM 599<small style=\"font:700 14px var(--f-body)\"> /yr</small></span><ul><li>Everything in monthly</li><li>2 months free</li><li>Two live classes a month</li></ul><a class=\"np-btn m\" href=\"#\">Choose yearly</a></div></div></section>","teachers":"<section class=\"np-sec\"><div class=\"np-h\"><i>師</i><h2>Teachers</h2></div><div class=\"np-grid\"><div class=\"np-card\"><span class=\"jp\">先</span><h3>Sakura-sensei</h3><p>Tokyo · beginners · 12 years teaching.</p></div><div class=\"np-card y\"><span class=\"jp\">先</span><h3>Kenta-sensei</h3><p>Osaka · conversation · loves slang.</p></div><div class=\"np-card\"><span class=\"jp\">先</span><h3>Yuki-sensei</h3><p>Sapporo · JLPT coach · patient with kanji.</p></div></div></section>","faq":"<section class=\"np-sec\"><div class=\"np-h\"><i>問</i><h2>FAQ</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details open><summary>I know zero Japanese. Where do I start?</summary><p>With the kana quiz and the Absolute beginner course. It assumes nothing.</p></details><details><summary>How long until I can hold a conversation?</summary><p>Most learners manage simple conversations after 8–12 weeks at 10 minutes a day.</p></details><details><summary>Is there a romaji version?</s